---
/**
 * REQ-41 negative fixture (test infrastructure, NOT a shipping module): a module
 * with a standalone interactive control far below the 44px minimum tap target.
 * The 20x20px block-level button is flagged `responsive.tap-target` in the mobile
 * band. It is a block button (not an inline-in-text link), so it is not covered
 * by the WCAG inline-anchor exemption. Inline styles only.
 */
---

<section style="padding: 24px">
  <h2>Small-tap-target fixture</h2>
  <p>The button below is only 20x20px — too small to tap reliably on mobile.</p>
  <button type="button" style="display: block; width: 20px; height: 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 12px">
    Go
  </button>
</section>
